<mjml lang="en-AU">
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>You're in, Helen! Your quote is accepted</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>We've got your $349.00 payment. Next up: your electrical safety check.</mj-preview>
    <mj-include path="./partials/head.mjml" />
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-wrapper css-class="card">
      <mj-include path="./partials/header.mjml" />

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="h1" css-class="email-heading">You're in, Helen!</mj-text>
          <mj-text>Thanks for accepting your quote. Warmer winters and cooler summers are on the way, with $1,850 off.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column mj-class="panel">
          <mj-text mj-class="eyebrow" padding="18px 18px 10px">Payment received</mj-text>
          <mj-table padding="0 18px 6px">
            <tr><td style="padding:0 12px 4px 0;font-size:16px;">Electrical safety check</td><td align="right" style="padding:0 0 4px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:16px;"><strong>$349.00</strong></td></tr>
            <tr><td class="muted" style="padding:0 12px 12px 0;font-size:13px;color:#5A6785;">Paid 24 Oct 2026 · card ending 4242</td><td align="right" style="padding:0 0 12px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:14px;color:#057D40;"><strong>Paid &#10003;</strong></td></tr>
            <tr><td colspan="2" style="border-top:1px solid #E4E9F5;padding:12px 0 12px;font-size:14px;color:#5A6785;">Still to pay: $1,851.00 (10% to book your install day, the rest on install day)</td></tr>
          </mj-table>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text mj-class="h2" css-class="email-sub" padding="18px 12px 12px">What happens next</mj-text>
          <mj-table padding="0 12px 6px">
            <tr><td width="36" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 14px;"><span class="num">1</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 14px;"><strong>Electrical safety check</strong><br /><span class="muted">A licensed electrician will offer you times. They check your wiring, downlights and switchboard are safe to insulate over.</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td width="36" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 14px;"><span class="num">2</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 14px;"><strong>Only if something needs fixing</strong><br /><span class="muted">We'll send you a separate quote. Nothing is done without your OK.</span></td></tr>
            <tr><td width="36" valign="top" style="padding:2px 0 12px;"><span class="num">3</span></td><td style="padding:0 0 12px;"><strong>Book your install day</strong><br /><span class="muted">Sample Insulation Co offers you 3 days. Your install is done within 30 days of the safety check.</span></td></tr>
          </mj-table>
          <mj-button href="https://estimate.homeinsulationvictoria.com.au/my-job/TEST">See my job</mj-button>
          <mj-text mj-class="small" padding="0 12px 0">Your signed acceptance and receipt are attached. Please keep this email. Questions? Just reply to this email.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-include path="./partials/footer-trade.mjml" />
    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
